    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In Java, if we need to perform set-related operations, we use hashset because it provides the functionality of a mathematical set."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "For example, if we need to store unique elements, it's better to use a hashset because, unlike arraylist and linkedlist, elements in a hashset cannot have duplicate values."
